                    <div class="guide-tip-card">
                        <h3>Lighting Pro Tips</h3>
                        <p>• Layer different types of lighting (ambient, task, accent) for a balanced, flexible scheme<br>
                           • Use dimmers to adjust light levels according to time of day and activity<br>
                           • Consider color temperature: warm (2700K-3000K) for cozy spaces, cool (3500K-5000K) for task areas<br>
                           • Place light sources at different heights to create depth and dimension<br>
                           • Use mirrors to reflect and amplify natural and artificial light</p>
